ERC-20 Token Project is to create a basic token smart contract deployed on Ethereum-compatible blockchains. Token transfer, allowance approvals, and balance checking are supported. Using *Solidity* for contract development and *OpenZeppelin* for pre-existing ERC-20 templates, the contract provides support for methods like transfer, approve, and balanceOf. Rapid deployment is possible through *Remix IDE* or commercial-grade with *Hardhat* for automated script deployment. For frontend integration, *ethers.js* can be utilized to facilitate user interaction with the token through an easy-to-use HTML interface. The project is well-structured with a clear directory structure including contracts, deployment scripts, and scalability and usability tests.